OL,5,G2000 Michael Palin: Travels of a
OL,6,G     Lifetime
OL,7,     FNew. Michael recalls the making of
OL,8,     FFull Circle, a journey around the
OL,9,     FPacific Rim which took him to
OL,10,     FRussia, China, Vietnam, Australia
OL,11,     Fand New Zealand and North and
OL,12,     FSouth America.
OL,13,G2100 Simon Reeve's South America
OL,14,     FSimon Reeve travels from Chile's
OL,15,     FAtacama Desert and follows the
OL,16,     FAndes to Patagonia before ending
OL,17,     Fup in most southerly inhabited
OL,18,     Fregion on earth, Tierra Del Fuego.
